              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઘડાવવું — ghaḍāvvũ — \"to have (something) made\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મીરાએ સોની પાસે એક વીંટી ઘડાવી. Mīrāe sonī pāse ek vī̃ṭī ghaḍāvī. Mira had a ring made by the goldsmith."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે વીંટી ઘડાવી, teṇe vī̃ṭī ghaḍāvī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઘડાવવું (ghaḍāvvũ) is built from ઘડવું, \"to shape\", with the causative -āv-: to have something shaped by another person, who takes પાસે. The family goes back to Sanskrit ghaṭ, whose causative ghaṭayati Monier-Williams gives as \"to join, to put together\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
